    "name": "What Is Wrong With You?",
    "steam_appid": 1499230,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the phenomenon of &quot;Who Wants To Be a Millionaire?&quot; phenomenon, this game show idea turns everything upisde down! In life, you always have to make the right decisions and answer correctly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But here everything is different!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The wrong answers are the right ones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16 questions separate you from a virtual top prize of 250,000! You can expect multiple choice questions with 4 answers A-B-C-D, but we won't tell you how many answers are right or wrong. The further you get, the more money we add to your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to win this show, you have to find and name all the wrong answers to all the given questions. At least 1 answer and a maximum of 3 answers are always correct! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you fail the task, you go home empty-handed! Unless you reach the security levels for questions 4, 8 and 12, the further you go through the game, the more difficult it will be for you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Show Must NOT Go On!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the phenomenon of &quot;Who Wants To Be a Millionaire?&quot; phenomenon, this game show idea turns everything upisde down! In life, you always have to make the right decisions and answer correctly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But here everything is different!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The wrong answers are the right ones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16 questions separate you from a virtual top prize of 250,000! You can expect multiple choice questions with 4 answers A-B-C-D, but we won't tell you how many answers are right or wrong. The further you get, the more money we add to your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to win this show, you have to find and name all the wrong answers to all the given questions. At least 1 answer and a maximum of 3 answers are always correct! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you fail the task, you go home empty-handed! Unless you reach the security levels for questions 4, 8 and 12, the further you go through the game, the more difficult it will be for you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Show Must NOT Go On!</p>",
